Description: Advanced MATE menu
 One of the most advanced menus under Linux. MintMenu supports filtering,
 favorites, easy-uninstallation, autosession, and many other features.
 .
 This is the Ageless Linux fork: uninstalling and installing work on plain
 Debian (no mintcommon or mintinstall needed), software search goes to
 packages.debian.org, and the default favorites suit Ageless Linux.
